# SHA-256 of build outputs that must match known-good images.
#
# Rivet v0.5.0: XTIDE Universal BIOS v1.1.5 plus XTIDE HI-SPEED mode
# (A0/A3 swapped, "Chuck mod") support, a rewritten boot menu, and the
# option to build without the boot menu, and per-drive CHS translation
# modes (the default, mode 0, is the v1.1.5 translation).
# *_hs.bin images default to HI-SPEED mode; the others default to the
# original register layout. *_nomenu.bin images leave out the boot menu
# and boot in BIOS order.
#
# v0.1.0 (identity change only) was verified identical to v1.1.5 from offset
# 60h up to the checksum byte. Later changes are described in the commits
# that introduced their hashes.
#
# Any change to these hashes must come with an intended change to the ROM,
# made in the same commit, and the commit message must say why.
